<!-- FAQ Content -->
<section class="container" style="padding: 4rem 0;">
  <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Is virtual physiotherapy as effective as in-person treatment?</h3>
      <p>Yes! Research shows that virtual physiotherapy is equally effective for many conditions. Our therapists can accurately assess movement patterns through video, provide real-time feedback, and guide exercises with the same expertise as in-person sessions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">What equipment do I need for virtual sessions?</h3>
      <p>Minimal equipment is required! You'll need a device with a camera and microphone (computer, tablet, or smartphone) and a stable internet connection. Some sessions may benefit from basic equipment like resistance bands or dumbbells, but these are optional and our therapists will advise.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Do I need insurance to book?</h3>
      <p>No! While many insurance plans cover physiotherapy, you don't need insurance to book with us. We accept direct payment from patients. If you have insurance, we provide detailed invoices for reimbursement claims.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Can serious injuries be treated without hands-on therapy?</h3>
      <p>Many conditions can be effectively treated through virtual physiotherapy with movement assessment, guided exercises, and manual therapy techniques demonstrated on video. Some complex cases may require in-person evaluation, and our therapists will advise if this is necessary.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">How long are sessions?</h3>
      <p>Standard sessions are 45-60 minutes. The first session is typically longer to include a comprehensive assessment. We also offer extended sessions (90 minutes) for complex cases.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">How often should I have sessions?</h3>
      <p>This depends on your condition. Most patients benefit from 2-3 sessions per week initially, reducing frequency as they improve. Your therapist will create a personalized plan and adjust based on your progress.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">What should I do if my internet is slow or unstable?</h3>
      <p>Contact us before your session if you experience internet issues. We can reschedule to a time when your connection is better. Most video platforms work well on standard internet, but we recommend testing your connection 10 minutes before your appointment.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Can I get a refund if I need to cancel?</h3>
      <p>We offer a full refund if you cancel at least 24 hours before your appointment. Cancellations within 24 hours may be subject to a cancellation fee.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">How do I receive my home exercise program?</h3>
      <p>After each session, you'll receive an email with detailed instructions for your home exercises, including videos and descriptions. You can also access these through your patient portal.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Is my personal information secure?</h3>
      <p>Yes. We use HIPAA-compliant video conferencing and secure data storage. Your medical information is confidential and protected under healthcare privacy laws.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">What if I'm not satisfied with my treatment?</h3>
      <p>We want you to feel confident in your care. If you have concerns, speak with your therapist immediately. We're committed to adjusting our approach to ensure you're getting the best results possible.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Still Have Questions -->
  <div style="background: var(--primary-light); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;">
    <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Still have questions?</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Contact us directly and our team will be happy to help.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</section>
